  "iso_week": "2026-W41",
  "markdown": "# Groww Review Pulse — 2026-W41\n\n*1,708 substantive reviews of 8,812 in window*\n\n**Reliability issues rise, fees spike, stop‑loss glitches increase**\n\n## Top themes\n\n- **App Reliability** ▲ (37 reviews, 25.7% of week, +5.6 pts vs prior 11 wks, 2.6★) — App fails to open or shows unhealthy upstream after updates\n- **Charges & Support** ▲ (32 reviews, 22.2% of week, +2.3 pts vs prior 11 wks, 2.6★) — Users complain about high brokerage and unresponsive support\n- **Orders & Execution** ▲ (44 reviews, 30.6% of week, +3.3 pts vs prior 11 wks, 3.7★) — Stop‑loss orders often not placed, causing losses\n\n## What users said\n\n> it's not even opening after updating the app. Always say there seems to be an issue with my internet even though other apps are working fine\n>\n> — 1★, App Reliability\n\n> they are absolute thief, they steel my money twice as Auto square off charges, when i close it manually...! don't trade by this app. give me my money back\n>\n> — 1★, Charges & Support\n\n> Please fix this glitch. Most of the time, the stop-loss doesn’t get placed, and because of this, I end up taking losses.\n>\n> — 3★, Orders & Execution\n\n## What to do next\n\n1. **Add fallback launch path to bypass unhealthy upstream check** (App Reliability) — Reduces login failures after updates\n2. **Introduce transparent brokerage fee breakdown in UI** (Charges & Support) — Helps users understand charges, reduces complaints\n3. **Implement reliable stop‑loss placement verification** (Orders & Execution) — Prevents missed stop‑losses, lowers loss exposure\n",
